            0.092,
            0.88,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "中文摘要（对项目的背景、主要研究内容、重要结果、关键数据及其科学意义等做简单概述）:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.128,
            0.89,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "本项目针对复杂金融市场条件下资本市场异常波动与共振，“金融危机不可预测”的质疑与“系统性风险监管无效”的悖论，应用机器学习算法优化与监管科技试图突破传统金融监管“短板”与金融危机监管难题，构建了建立中国资本市场系统性风险识别、监测、评估与管控体系。项目主要通过大数据技术、机器学习及监管科技等对复杂风险网络结构下中国资本市场系统性风险进行识别、预警、监测与评估，应用复杂网络空间模型和微观机制挖掘资本市场系统性风险生成路径并对风险传染进行仿真冲击，对我国资本市场重大潜在风险共振、集聚、传染与风险溢出进行风险预警建模。课题应用机器学习算法和复杂网络模型对中国资本市场系统性金融风险测度与预警研究，机器学习算法与系统性金融风险生成机制分析的结合，在提升风险预警效率的同时，使得具有黑箱性质的机器学习算法具有可解释性，该研究对中国资本市场系统性风险防范和国家金融安全管理具有政策启示。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.37,
            0.763,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Abstract (Brief description of research background, main methods, contributions, and research data):"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.406,
            0.893,
            0.751
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This project is to solve the paradox of \"unpredictable financial crisis\" and \"ineffective regulation of systemic risk\", under the condition of complex financial market, abnormal fluctuations and resonance in the capital market, We used machine learning algorithm and supervise technology to break through the \"short board\" of traditional financial supervision and the difficult problem of financial crisis supervision, and established a systematic risk identification, monitoring, evaluation, and control system for the Chinese capital market. Specifically, this project mainly used big data technology, machine learning and supervision technology to identify, early warning, monitor and evaluate systemic risks in China's capital market under a complex risk network structure. Afterwards, we applied complex cyberspace models and micro-mechanisms to dig out the generation path of systemic risk of the capital market and simulate the impact of risk contagion. Then we tried to build a risk early warning model, which used to identify the risk resonance, accumulation, contagion and risk spillover of China' s significant potential risk. Finally, the project used the big data model and artificial intelligence (AI) engineering principle to optimize the algorithm and build a technology regulatory system of financial market in China's capital market. This project provided forward-looking and systematic solutions for the dynamic, intelligent warning and control of significant risks in China's capital market.This Project have policy implications for the prevention of systemic risks in China's capital market and national financial security management."
            }
          ]
        },
